    skos:altLabel "MO"@en ;
    skos:definition "The molecular orbital whose occupation by electrons decreases the total bonding (as usual, increases the total energy) of a molecule. The energy level of an antibonding MO lies higher than the average of the valence atomic orbitals of the atoms constituting the molecule."@en ;
